flowchart TD
    A{Authentication action}

    A -->|Register| B[POST /api/auth/register]
    B --> C[Pydantic validates name, email and password]
    C -->|Invalid| D[Return 422 validation error]
    C -->|Valid| E[Find user by email]
    E -->|Already exists| F[Return 400 email already exists]
    E -->|New email| G[Hash password and create user]
    G --> H[Return registration success and user ID]

    A -->|Log in| I[POST /api/auth/login]
    I --> J[Pydantic validates email and password]
    J -->|Invalid| D
    J -->|Valid| K[Find user by email]
    K -->|Missing| L[Return 401 invalid credentials]
    K -->|Found| M[Verify password hash]
    M -->|Incorrect| L
    M -->|Correct| N[Generate signed JWT with user ID, email and expiry]
    N --> O[Return bearer token and user details]
    O --> P[PTAS API client sends Authorization header]

    NOTE[Current protected routes do not yet decode or enforce the bearer token]
    P -.-> NOTE
